// Title: MMC Loading Script Engines DLLs
// Rule ID: a9c73e8b-3b2d-4c45-8ef2-5f9a9c9998ad
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1059.005, attack.t1218.014
// Category: image_load
